<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="uz">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>BilimAI platformasi</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Manrope:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Unbounded:wght@500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
/* VOICE: friendly, encouraging study companion for 5–9 graders; clear and calm
   IDEA: a school planner (kundalik) — each subject a coloured textbook, each topic a lesson card
   PICTURE: deep-indigo hero band with a glowing knowledge network and the "lesson of the day" card
   COLOUR and TYPE: BilimAI indigo + pink + cyan; six subject colours; Unbounded titles, Manrope text
   LAYOUT: top bar + grade switch; main column; AI tutor panel docked right on wide screens, a tab on phones */
:root{color-scheme:light dark;
--bg:light-dark(#F5F3FB,#0D0A24);--card:light-dark(#FFFFFF,#17123A);--ink:light-dark(#18132F,#F1EEFA);
--mute:light-dark(#5E5880,#B3ACD4);--line:light-dark(#E4E0F2,#2B2458);--soft:light-dark(#EEEAF9,#1F1948);
--brand:#2A1B6E;--pink:#E2367F;--cyan:#22C3D8;--ok:#12A26B;--bad:#D93A4A}
:root[data-theme=light]{color-scheme:light}:root[data-theme=dark]{color-scheme:dark}
*{box-sizing:border-box;min-width:0}
[hidden]{display:none!important}
body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:16px/1.55 Manrope,system-ui,sans-serif;overflow-x:clip}
h1,h2,h3{font-family:Unbounded,Manrope,sans-serif;line-height:1.15;margin:0;text-wrap:balance;letter-spacing:-.01em}
button{font:inherit;color:inherit;cursor:pointer}
button:focus-visible,input:focus-visible,textarea:focus-visible,a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--cyan);outline-offset:2px}
.top{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:20;background:#1B1150;color:#F4F1FA;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:10px max(3vw,14px);flex-wrap:wrap}
.logo{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;background:none;border:0;padding:4px 0;color:#fff}
.logo b{font-family:Unbounded,Manrope,sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:800}.logo b i{font-style:normal;color:#FF5FA2}
.grades{display:flex;gap:4px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);border-radius:999px;padding:4px;margin-left:auto}
.grades button{border:0;background:none;color:#D9D3F2;border-radius:999px;min-width:44px;height:38px;font-weight:700;padding:0 10px}
.grades button[aria-pressed=true]{background:#fff;color:#1B1150}
.grades span{align-self:center;font-size:13px;color:#B9B2D6;padding:0 6px 0 8px}
.tbtn{border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.25);background:none;color:#fff;border-radius:12px;height:42px;padding:0 14px;font-weight:700;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}
.app{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);max-width:1440px;margin:0 auto}
@media(min-width:1100px){.app{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 400px}.bnav{display:none!important}.aiopen{display:none!important}}
#view{padding:0 0 96px}
.wrap{padding:24px max(3vw,16px)}
.hero{background:#1B1150;color:#F4F1FA;position:relative;overflow:hidden;padding:28px max(3vw,16px) 36px}
.hero svg.net{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;opacity:.9}
.hero-in{position:relative;display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.1fr) minmax(0,.9fr);gap:28px;align-items:center}
@media(max-width:820px){.hero-in{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}.hero svg.net{opacity:.4}}
@media(max-width:1099px){#resBtn{display:none}}
.hero h1{font-size:clamp(28px,4.2vw,46px);font-weight:800}
.hero p.sub{color:#CFC8EE;font-size:17px;margin:12px 0 20px;max-width:560px}
.search{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;background:#fff;border-radius:16px;padding:6px 6px 6px 16px;max-width:560px}
.search input{flex:1;border:0;outline:0;font:inherit;font-size:16px;color:#18132F;background:none;height:44px}
.chips{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:18px}
.chip{background:rgba(255,255,255,.1);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18);border-radius:999px;padding:6px 14px;font-size:14px;color:#E6E1F8}
.chip b{color:#fff}
.lotd{background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2);border-radius:24px;padding:24px;backdrop-filter:blur(6px)}
.lotd small{color:#8FE9F4;font-weight:700;font-size:13px}
.lotd h3{font-size:22px;margin:8px 0 10px;color:#fff}
.lotd p{color:#D6D0F0;margin:0 0 16px;font-size:15px;display:-webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp:3;-webkit-box-orient:vertical;overflow:hidden}
.btn{border:0;border-radius:14px;min-height:44px;padding:0 18px;font-weight:700;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:var(--pink);color:#fff}
.btn.ghost{background:var(--soft);color:var(--ink)}
.btn.line{background:none;border:1.5px solid var(--line);color:var(--ink)}
.btn:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:default}
.sec-h{display:flex;align-items:end;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;margin:8px 0 16px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.sec-h h2{font-size:24px}.sec-h p{margin:0;color:var(--mute)}
.subjects{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(250px,1fr));gap:16px}
.scard{text-align:left;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--card);border-radius:22px;padding:20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;transition:transform .2s}
.scard:hover{transform:translateY(-3px)}
.scard .spine{position:absolute;left:0;top:0;bottom:0;width:8px}
.ico{width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:16px;display:grid;place-items:center;flex:none}
.ico svg{width:28px;height:28px}
.scard h3{font-size:19px}.scard p{margin:0;color:var(--mute);font-size:14px}
.bar{height:8px;border-radius:99px;background:var(--soft);overflow:hidden}.bar i{display:block;height:100%;border-radius:99px}
.meta{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:13px;color:var(--mute);font-weight:600}
.shead{color:#fff;padding:28px max(3vw,16px);display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap}
.shead .ico{background:rgba(255,255,255,.18);width:64px;height:64px}.shead .ico svg{width:34px;height:34px}
.shead h1{font-size:clamp(26px,3.6vw,38px)}.shead p{margin:4px 0 0;opacity:.9}
.crumb{background:none;border:0;color:inherit;opacity:.85;padding:0;font-weight:600;font-size:14px;min-height:32px}
.topics{display:grid;gap:14px}
.tcard{text-align:left;background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:20px;padding:18px 20px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto minmax(0,1fr) auto;gap:16px;align-items:center}
.tnum{width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:14px;display:grid;place-items:center;font-family:Unbounded,Manrope,sans-serif;font-weight:700;color:#fff}
.tcard h3{font-size:17px;margin-bottom:4px}.tcard p{margin:0;color:var(--mute);font-size:14px;display:-webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp:2;-webkit-box-orient:vertical;overflow:hidden}
.badge{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;border-radius:999px;padding:4px 12px;white-space:nowrap;background:var(--soft);color:var(--mute)}
.badge.done{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ok) 16%,transparent);color:var(--ok)}
.badge.part{background:color-mix(in srgb,#E8A23A 20%,transparent);color:light-dark(#9A5C00,#F3C06B)}
@media(max-width:560px){.tcard{grid-template-columns:auto minmax(0,1fr)}.tcard .badge{grid-column:2;justify-self:start}}
.lesson{display:grid;gap:18px;max-width:880px}
.panel{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:22px;padding:22px}
.panel h2{font-size:20px;margin-bottom:12px}
.expl{font-size:18px;line-height:1.65;margin:0}
.tools{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:18px}
.aiout{margin-top:16px;border-left:4px solid var(--cyan);background:var(--soft);border-radius:0 16px 16px 0;padding:14px 18px;display:none}
.aiout.on{display:block}
.md p{margin:0 0 8px}.md ul{margin:4px 0 8px;padding-left:20px}.md code{background:var(--soft);padding:1px 6px;border-radius:6px}
.q{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;padding:16px;margin-top:12px}
.q h4{margin:0 0 12px;font-size:17px}
.opts{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:10px}
@media(max-width:520px){.opts{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}}
.opt{text-align:left;border:1.5px solid var(--line);background:var(--card);border-radius:14px;min-height:48px;padding:10px 14px;font-weight:600}
.opt:hover:not(:disabled){border-color:var(--cyan)}
.opt.ok{border-color:var(--ok);background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ok) 14%,var(--card))}
.opt.no{border-color:var(--bad);background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--bad) 12%,var(--card))}
.opt:disabled{cursor:default}
.why{margin:10px 0 0;font-size:14px;color:var(--mute)}
.score{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin-top:16px;padding:14px 16px;border-radius:16px;background:var(--soft);flex-wrap:wrap}
.score b{font-family:Unbounded,Manrope,sans-serif;font-size:22px}
.pager{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(170px,1fr));gap:14px}
.stat{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:20px;padding:18px}
.stat b{display:block;font-family:Unbounded,Manrope,sans-serif;font-size:clamp(26px,3vw,34px);color:var(--pink)}
.stat span{color:var(--mute);font-size:14px}
.prow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:200px minmax(0,1fr) 56px;gap:14px;align-items:center;padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.prow span:last-child{text-align:right;font-weight:700}
@media(max-width:560px){.prow{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 56px}.prow .bar{grid-column:1/-1;grid-row:2}}
.rec{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.rec small{color:var(--mute)}
/* AI panel */
.ai{background:var(--card);border-left:1px solid var(--line);display:flex;flex-direction:column;height:calc(100vh - 62px);position:sticky;top:62px}
@media(max-width:1099px){.ai{display:none;position:fixed;inset:0;top:0;height:100%;z-index:40;border:0}.ai.show{display:flex}}
.ai-h{padding:16px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}
.ai-h h2{font-size:17px}.ai-h p{margin:0;font-size:13px;color:var(--mute)}
.ai-close{margin-left:auto;border:0;background:var(--soft);border-radius:12px;width:44px;height:44px}
@media(min-width:1100px){.ai-close{display:none}}
.ctx{margin:12px 18px 0;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:12px;background:var(--soft);font-size:13px;color:var(--mute);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;align-items:center}
.ctx button{border:0;background:none;color:var(--pink);font-weight:700;font-size:13px;min-height:32px}
.msgs{flex:1;overflow:auto;padding:16px 18px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}
.m{max-width:88%;padding:12px 14px;border-radius:18px;font-size:15px}
.m.u{align-self:flex-end;background:var(--pink);color:#fff;border-bottom-right-radius:6px}
.m.a{align-self:flex-start;background:var(--soft);border-bottom-left-radius:6px}
.sugg{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:0 18px 10px}
.sugg button{border:1.5px solid var(--line);background:none;border-radius:999px;padding:6px 12px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;min-height:36px}
.ai-in{display:flex;gap:8px;padding:12px 14px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);align-items:flex-end}
.ai-in textarea{flex:1;resize:none;border:1.5px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:11px 12px;font:inherit;font-size:16px;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);max-height:140px}
.ib{border:0;width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:14px;display:grid;place-items:center;background:var(--soft);flex:none}
.ib.send{background:var(--pink);color:#fff}.ib.rec{background:var(--bad);color:#fff}
.ib svg{width:22px;height:22px}
.note{font-size:13px;color:var(--mute);padding:0 18px 12px}
.bnav{position:fixed;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;z-index:30;background:var(--card);border-top:1px solid var(--line);display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);padding:6px 6px calc(6px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom))}
.bnav button{border:0;background:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:2px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:var(--mute);min-height:52px;border-radius:12px}
.bnav button[aria-current=true]{color:var(--pink)}
.bnav svg{width:24px;height:24px}
.empty{color:var(--mute);padding:20px 0}
.foot{color:var(--mute);font-size:13px;padding:8px max(3vw,16px) 24px}
.modal{position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(10,6,30,.55);display:none;place-items:center;z-index:60;padding:16px}
.modal.on{display:grid}.modal .panel{max-width:420px}
.dots::after{content:'';animation:dots 1.2s steps(4) infinite}
@keyframes dots{0%{content:''}25%{content:'.'}50%{content:'..'}75%{content:'...'}}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.scard{transition:none}.dots::after{animation:none;content:'...'}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header class="top">
<button class="logo" id="home" aria-label="Bosh sahifa">
<svg width="34" height="34" viewBox="0 0 34 34" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="34" height="34" rx="10" fill="#E2367F"/><path d="M8 11.5c3-1.6 6-1.6 9 0v13c-3-1.6-6-1.6-9 0z" fill="#fff"/><path d="M17 11.5c3-1.6 6-1.6 9 0v13c-3-1.6-6-1.6-9 0z" fill="#FFD3E6"/><circle cx="26" cy="8" r="2.4" fill="#5FE3F2"/></svg>
<b>Bilim<i>AI</i></b></button>
<div class="grades" role="group" aria-label="Sinfni tanlang"><span>Sinf</span></div>
<button class="tbtn" id="resBtn"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M4 20V10M10 20V4M16 20v-7M22 20H2"/></svg><span>Natijalarim</span></button>
</header>
<div class="app">
<main id="view" aria-live="polite"></main>
<aside class="ai" id="ai" aria-label="AI yordamchi">
<div class="ai-h"><div class="ico" style="background:#2A1B6E;width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:14px"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="#5FE3F2" stroke-width="1.8"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/><circle cx="4" cy="6" r="1.6"/><circle cx="20" cy="6" r="1.6"/><circle cx="4" cy="18" r="1.6"/><circle cx="20" cy="18" r="1.6"/><path d="M5.4 7l4.2 3.3M18.6 7l-4.2 3.3M5.4 17l4.2-3.3M18.6 17l-4.2-3.3"/></svg></div>
<div><h2>AI yordamchi</h2><p id="aiState">Ulanmoqda…</p></div>
<button class="ai-close" id="aiClose" aria-label="Yopish">✕</button></div>
<div class="ctx" id="ctx"></div>
<div class="msgs" id="msgs"></div>
<div class="sugg" id="sugg"></div>
<p class="note" id="aiNote" hidden></p>
<form class="ai-in" id="aiForm">
<button type="button" class="ib" id="mic" aria-label="Ovoz bilan so‘rash" hidden><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="9" y="3" width="6" height="11" rx="3"/><path d="M5 11a7 7 0 0 0 14 0M12 18v3"/></svg></button>
<textarea id="q" rows="1" placeholder="Savolingizni yozing…" aria-label="Savol"></textarea>
<button class="ib send" id="send" aria-label="Yuborish"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="M4 12l16-8-6 16-2.5-6.5z"/></svg></button>
</form>
</aside>
</div>
<nav class="bnav" aria-label="Asosiy menyu">
<button data-nav="home" aria-current="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M3 11l9-7 9 7v9a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-5v-6h-6v6H4a1 1 0 0 1-1-1z"/></svg>Fanlar</button>
<button data-nav="ai"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M4 5h16v11H9l-5 4z"/><path d="M8 10h8M8 13h5"/></svg>AI yordamchi</button>
<button data-nav="res"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M4 20V10M10 20V4M16 20v-7M22 20H2"/></svg>Natijalar</button>
</nav>
<div class="modal" id="modal"><div class="panel"><h2>Natijalarni tozalash</h2><p>Barcha test natijalari o‘chiriladi. Davom etasizmi?</p><div class="tools"><button class="btn" id="mYes">Ha, tozalash</button><button class="btn ghost" id="mNo">Bekor qilish</button></div></div></div>
<script>
const SUBJ=[
{id:'tarix',name:'Tarix',color:'#E8833A',d:'Qadimgi dunyodan Mustaqil O‘zbekistongacha'},
{id:'math',name:'Matematika',color:'#4F6BFF',d:'Sonlar, tenglamalar, geometriya'},
{id:'ona',name:'Ona tili',color:'#0FA88E',d:'Fonetika, so‘z turkumlari, sintaksis'},
{id:'eng',name:'Ingliz tili',color:'#E2367F',d:'Grammar, tenses, vocabulary'},
{id:'rus',name:'Rus tili',color:'#7C5CE6',d:'Грамматика: род, падеж, глагол'},
{id:'it',name:'Kompyuter savodxonligi',color:'#0A9BD1',d:'Qurilmalar, internet, algoritm, Python'}
];
const T={
math:{
5:[['Natural sonlar va amallar','Natural sonlar — sanashda ishlatiladigan 1, 2, 3, … sonlar. Amallar tartibi: avval qavs ichidagi amallar, keyin ko‘paytirish va bo‘lish, so‘ng qo‘shish va ayirish. Misol: 2 + 3 · 4 = 2 + 12 = 14.',[['8 + 2 · 5 = ?',['50','18','20','15'],1],['Eng kichik natural son qaysi?',['0','1','2','−1'],1]]],
['Oddiy kasrlar','Kasr butunning qismini bildiradi: a/b da b (maxraj) — butun nechta teng qismga bo‘linganini, a (surat) — nechta qism olinganini ko‘rsatadi. Maxrajlari teng kasrlarni qo‘shishda suratlar qo‘shiladi: 2/7 + 3/7 = 5/7.',[['1/5 + 2/5 = ?',['3/10','3/5','2/5','1/5'],1],['3/4 kasrning maxraji nechaga teng?',['3','4','7','12'],1]]],
['O‘nli kasrlar','O‘nli kasr — maxraji 10, 100, 1000 bo‘lgan kasrning qisqa yozuvi: 3/10 = 0,3; 25/100 = 0,25. Qo‘shish va ayirishda vergullar bir-birining ostiga yoziladi.',[['0,5 qaysi oddiy kasrga teng?',['1/5','1/2','5/100','2/5'],1],['1,2 + 0,35 = ?',['1,55','1,37','4,7','1,25'],0]]]],
6:[['Bo‘linish belgilari, EKUB va EKUK','Son 2 ga bo‘linadi, agar oxirgi raqami juft bo‘lsa; 3 ga — raqamlari yig‘indisi 3 ga bo‘linsa; 5 ga — oxirgi raqami 0 yoki 5 bo‘lsa. EKUB — eng katta umumiy bo‘luvchi, EKUK — eng kichik umumiy karrali. Masalan, EKUB(12; 18) = 6, EKUK(4; 6) = 12.',[['Qaysi son 3 ga bo‘linadi?',['124','215','342','101'],2],['EKUK(3; 4) = ?',['7','12','1','24'],1]]],
['Nisbat va proporsiya','Nisbat — ikki sonning bo‘linmasi (a : b). Proporsiya — ikki nisbatning tengligi: a : b = c : d. Asosiy xossasi: chetki hadlar ko‘paytmasi o‘rta hadlar ko‘paytmasiga teng (a · d = b · c).',[['2 : x = 4 : 10 bo‘lsa, x = ?',['5','8','20','2'],0],['6 : 3 nisbatning qiymati?',['3','2','18','0,5'],1]]],
['Musbat va manfiy sonlar','Noldan katta sonlar musbat, kichiklari manfiy. Sonning moduli — uning noldan masofasi: |−7| = 7. Ishoralari har xil sonlarni qo‘shishda modullar ayiriladi va moduli kattaroq sonning ishorasi qo‘yiladi: −8 + 5 = −3.',[['−6 + 10 = ?',['−16','4','−4','16'],1],['|−12| = ?',['−12','12','0','1/12'],1]]]],
7:[['Birhad va ko‘phadlar','Birhad — sonlar va o‘zgaruvchilar ko‘paytmasi, masalan 3a²b. Ko‘phad — birhadlar yig‘indisi. O‘xshash hadlar (harfiy qismi bir xil) koeffitsiyentlarni qo‘shish orqali ixchamlanadi: 5x + 2x = 7x.',[['4a + 3b − a = ?',['6ab','3a + 3b','4a + 2b','7ab'],1],['2x · 3x = ?',['5x','6x','6x²','5x²'],2]]],
['Qisqa ko‘paytirish formulalari','(a + b)² = a² + 2ab + b²; (a − b)² = a² − 2ab + b²; a² − b² = (a − b)(a + b). Bu formulalar hisoblashni tezlashtiradi: 51² = (50 + 1)² = 2500 + 100 + 1 = 2601.',[['(x + 3)² = ?',['x² + 9','x² + 3x + 9','x² + 6x + 9','x² + 6x + 6'],2],['49² − 1 qaysi ko‘paytmaga teng?',['48 · 50','49 · 48','50 · 50','48 · 48'],0]]],
['Uchburchak burchaklari','Har qanday uchburchak ichki burchaklarining yig‘indisi 180° ga teng. Teng yonli uchburchakda asosdagi burchaklar teng, teng tomonli uchburchakda har bir burchak 60°.',[['Uchburchakning ikki burchagi 50° va 70°. Uchinchisi?',['50°','60°','70°','80°'],1],['Teng tomonli uchburchakning bir burchagi?',['45°','60°','90°','30°'],1]]]],
8:[['Kvadrat ildiz','a sonining arifmetik kvadrat ildizi — kvadrati a ga teng bo‘lgan manfiy bo‘lmagan son: √49 = 7, chunki 7² = 49. Manfiy sondan haqiqiy kvadrat ildiz chiqarilmaydi. Xossa: √(a · b) = √a · √b.',[['√81 = ?',['8','9','−9','40,5'],1],['√(4 · 25) = ?',['10','29','100','20'],0]]],
['Kvadrat tenglamalar','ax² + bx + c = 0 (a ≠ 0) ko‘rinishidagi tenglama. Diskriminant D = b² − 4ac. D > 0 bo‘lsa ikki ildiz, D = 0 bo‘lsa bitta ildiz, D < 0 bo‘lsa haqiqiy ildiz yo‘q. Ildizlar: x = (−b ± √D) / 2a.',[['x² − 5x + 6 = 0 tenglamaning ildizlari?',['1 va 6','2 va 3','−2 va −3','−1 va 6'],1],['x² + 4x + 4 = 0 uchun D = ?',['0','32','16','8'],0]]],
['Pifagor teoremasi','To‘g‘ri burchakli uchburchakda gipotenuza kvadrati katetlar kvadratlari yig‘indisiga teng: c² = a² + b². Masalan, katetlar 3 va 4 bo‘lsa, gipotenuza 5 ga teng.',[['Katetlari 6 va 8 bo‘lgan uchburchakning gipotenuzasi?',['10','14','12','48'],0],['Gipotenuza 13, bir katet 5. Ikkinchi katet?',['8','12','18','10'],1]]]],
9:[['Kvadrat funksiya','y = ax² + bx + c funksiyaning grafigi — parabola. a > 0 bo‘lsa shoxlari yuqoriga, a < 0 bo‘lsa pastga qaragan. Parabola uchining abssissasi: x₀ = −b / 2a.',[['y = −2x² + 3 parabola shoxlari qayerga qaragan?',['Yuqoriga','Pastga','O‘ngga','Chapga'],1],['y = x² − 4x + 1 parabola uchining abssissasi?',['−2','2','4','1'],1]]],
['Arifmetik progressiya','Har bir hadi oldingisiga bir xil d sonni qo‘shish bilan hosil bo‘ladigan ketma-ketlik. n-hadi: aₙ = a₁ + (n − 1)d. Masalan, 2, 5, 8, 11, … uchun d = 3.',[['3, 7, 11, … progressiyaning ayirmasi d = ?',['3','4','7','10'],1],['a₁ = 2, d = 3 bo‘lsa, a₁₀ = ?',['29','32','30','27'],0]]],
['Trigonometriya asoslari','To‘g‘ri burchakli uchburchakda o‘tkir burchak sinusi — qarshisidagi katetning gipotenuzaga nisbati, kosinusi — yopishgan katetning gipotenuzaga nisbati. Muhim qiymatlar: sin 30° = 1/2, cos 60° = 1/2, sin²α + cos²α = 1.',[['sin 30° = ?',['1','1/2','√3/2','0'],1],['sin²α + cos²α = ?',['0','2','1','sin 2α'],2]]]]
},
